 Cries # gen2recomp
 Cries 
 Cries A reimplementation of Pokémon Gold, Silver, and Crystal in Lua and LÖVE, in the
 Cries same spirit as [gen1recomp](https://github.com/bryanthaboi/gen1recomp).
 Cries 
 Cries The engine is hand-written. Game data — species, moves, text, graphics, maps,
 Cries music — is extracted from a cartridge image that you supply. The image is
 Cries verified, read once during import, and released. **It is never copied into the
 Cries cache and it is never written to disk.** No ROM is included here, and this
 Cries project does not emulate the Game Boy.
 Cries 
