 Cries ## On pokecrystal
 Cries 
 Cries The script opcode table in `src/rom/script_ops.lua` — command names and operand
 Cries widths — is written from the [pokecrystal](https://github.com/pret/pokecrystal)
 Cries disassembly's documentation of the script macros.
 Cries 
 Cries Nothing from that project is vendored here. It is used as a reference for facts:
 Cries opcode numbers, operand widths, formula constants. Every one of those facts is
 Cries then validated against the cartridge by walking all 1,500 scripts and checking
 Cries where the walks land. Data continues to be *found* by signature search rather
 Cries than by hardcoded offset, so the importer still works across Gold, Silver and
 Cries Crystal from one code path.
